```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser (Client)
    participant NestJS as NestJS API (Ubuntu)
    participant LiveKitSrv as LiveKit Server (Ubuntu)
    participant Remote as Remote Participant

    Browser->>NestJS: POST /livekit/token\n{ targetSessionId: "abc123" }
    Note over NestJS: Validates session,\ngenerates JWT with\nroom name + identity

    NestJS-->>Browser: { token: "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1..." }

    Browser->>LiveKitSrv: Room.connect(NEXT_PUBLIC_LIVEKIT_URL, token)
    LiveKitSrv-->>Browser: Connected ✓

    Browser->>LiveKitSrv: Publish camera track
    Browser->>LiveKitSrv: Publish microphone track

    Remote->>LiveKitSrv: Room.connect(same room, own token)
    LiveKitSrv-->>Remote: Connected ✓

    LiveKitSrv->>Browser: TrackSubscribed (remote video)
    Browser->>Browser: track.attach() → HTMLVideoElement\nRender in VideoOverlay

    LiveKitSrv->>Browser: TrackSubscribed (remote audio)
    Browser->>Browser: track.attach() → audio plays

    Note over Browser: Avatar walks away (proximity-end)
    Browser->>LiveKitSrv: Room.disconnect()
    Browser->>Browser: Stop local tracks\nRemove video elements
```
